WEBVTT

00:12:59.454 --> 00:13:04.308
by infinitely enriching it with material
and additional artifacts --

00:13:04.887 --> 00:13:06.996
artifacts that we furnish

00:13:07.020 --> 00:13:08.995
by our strivings

00:13:09.019 --> 00:13:10.432
in the knowledge field.

00:13:11.047 --> 00:13:12.453
Thank you very much.

00:13:12.477 --> 00:13:16.269
(Applause)